<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Refit</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Class: none (no guild teaches it)
Mana: 50
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast refit &lt;item&gt; &lt;person&gt;
cast refit boots eve
</pre>
<p>The caster grasps a piece of armour, clothing or a weapon, utters 
'slarquveemzpe', and the item grows or shrinks to fit the person named, 
who must be in the room with you. The bigger the 
change in size, the harder the spell; well-made armour, shields and weapons 
are harder to refit than poor ones.
</p><p>Items that are already magical can't be refit, and an item can be refit 
only once: it becomes magical itself. It keeps its new size until a dispel 
magic strong enough undoes the spell; then it returns to its old size, and 
falls off if it was worn. You must be standing. No guild teaches it, but it 
turns up on scrolls among random treasure.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Resize</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Dispel Magic</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Creation Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>